  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It doesn't seem fair that we have tens of thousands of worlds available to explore in this game, and We can only favorite 400 of them. I'm about 50 worlds from maxing out my favorites list, and they are no longer catagorized. What used to be my \"games\", \"Exploration\", \"photography\" tabs have now all just become mixed because I have no more room for pretty worlds. It'd be really nice if we could get a few more lists available so I don't have to be so finicky about what I favorite\n\n(please not vrc+ exclusive please i don't have money)",
